#: ../../index.rst:4 77b015ad1a60469f9dfab2f42e261e8d
msgid ""
"A web console for MHVTL, the Linux virtual tape library. It creates "
"libraries, fills them with tapes, drives the robot, exports them over "
"iSCSI, and shows what a drive is doing while a backup writes to it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../index.rst:8 1f4992ecfb82457e855d080bc99b7db1
msgid ""
"Everything here can also be done from the terminal. Each task shows both,"
" side by side, because they are the same code underneath: the console and"
" the ``mhvtl`` command call one service, so neither can do something the "
"other cannot."
msgstr ""

